09. GET /temporal/entityMaps without timerel - 400
==================================================
HTTP/1.1 400 Bad Request
Date: REGEX(.*)
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 176

{
  "detail": "missing required URL parameter 'timerel'",
  "status": 400,
  "title": "Missing URL Parameter",
  "type": "https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/errors/BadRequestData"
}



10. POST /temporal/entityMaps, a Query without temporalQ - 400
==============================================================
HTTP/1.1 400 Bad Request
Date: REGEX(.*)
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 176

{
  "detail": "missing required URL parameter 'timerel'",
  "status": 400,
  "title": "Missing URL Parameter",
  "type": "https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/errors/BadRequestData"
}



11. GET /temporal/entityMaps with neither type, attrs, q, georel nor local - 400 (too broad)
===========================================================================================
HTTP/1.1 400 Bad Request
Date: REGEX(.*)
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 242

{
  "detail": "at least one of 'type', 'attrs', 'q', 'georel', or 'local' must be supplied - a list of entity ids is not enough",
  "status": 400,
  "title": "Query Too Broad",
  "type": "https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/errors/BadRequestData"
}



12. GET /temporal/entityMaps, pick of a linked entity - 400
===========================================================
HTTP/1.1 400 Bad Request
Date: REGEX(.*)
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 226

{
  "detail": "'pick' uses a linked-entity projection ('speed{id}'), which a temporal query does not support",
  "status": 400,
  "title": "Invalid Projection",
  "type": "https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/errors/BadRequestData"
}



--TEARDOWN--
coraineStop
corDbDrop
corTroeDrop
